<title>POLAND: BWR MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 79.000.</title>
<headline>BWR MARCH NET FALLS TO PLN 79.000.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.08 vs    0.96</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.32 vs    0.18</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  4.42 vs    3.12</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	10.02 vs    7.37</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.55 vs    1.97</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    0.94 vs    1.97</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 10.63 vs    8.54</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	26.78 vs   19.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Wspaopracy</p>
<p>Regionalnej SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
